  "name": "alexandria-client",
  "description": "A Rust-based API client library for the Alexandria digital library system, facilitating high-level interaction with Alexandria servers. It provides abstractions for querying book metadata by ISBN or collection indices using the Hyper HTTP stack and legacy Rust serialization patterns. The implementation employs a type-safe state pattern to distinguish between authenticated and unauthenticated server sessions, ensuring structured access to library resources.",
